 mode: up to 4 people on the same screen to fight against evil forces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinctive character fighting methods: each character has its unique fighting method, rejecting homogenized fighting rhythm and performance methods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metal Slug-like level-breaking experience: fast-paced, multi-variable, and diversified themed level mechanisms and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple level tasks: each level has a unique theme and level mechanism, terrain changes, traps, and even tracking battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brilliant BOSS battle experience: smart enemies increase the fun of in-game challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty level: There is a difficulty level, whether you are a video game novice or The difficulty is appropriate for all action game masters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic difficulty: In multiplayer games, the difficulty will be adjusted according to the number of players present to maintain the balance of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment upgrade: After passing the level, you can get points to upgrade the main and secondary weapons and auxiliary equipment of the character. In addition to the strength value, some equipment will change its performance after upgrading.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill combination: Different equipment has different skills, and the skills are linked to each other to achieve the most variable effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action and shooting mixed elements: Smooth movements and hitting feel experience the action elements, while guns and gunpowder show the shooting elements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/850860/extras/e308fe3bbf45